```

For example, given the following type:
```csharp
public class ExampleType
{
    public int ExampleField;
    public string ExampleProperty { get; set; }
    public void ExampleMethod() { }
}
```
The function `EnumerateTypeMembers(typeof(ExampleType))` should return a list containing the strings "ExampleField", "ExampleProperty", and "ExampleMethod".

