    public string Name { get; set; }
    public int Age { get; set; }
}

var person = new Person { Name = "Alice", Age = 30 };
```

The `Stringify` method should produce the following string representation:

```
Person { Name: "Alice", Age: 30 }
```

Ensure that your implementation can handle nested objects and collections as well.

