You are given a partial implementation of the CRC32 algorithm in the `Crc32` class within the `StreamDb.Internal.Support` namespace. The class contains a constant `DefaultPolynomial` with the value `0xedb88320`, which represents the default polynomial used in the CRC32 algorithm.

