However, this kind of effect can be achieved with a combination of steps. 

1. You can create a region (using GraphicsPath) which approximately matches your curved path. 
2. Then fill the region with a linear gradient (using LinearGradientBrush) along the perpendicular direction of your path.
3. Then you can Draw the GraphicsPath over the filled region with a Pen of suitable color and width.

