Then have the ClassItem implement this interface:

```csharp
public class ClassItem : IClassItem
{
    // implementation...
}
```

Now, in your `MyClass`, you can still return `IClassItem`, but the client code knows nothing about the specific implementation (`ClassItem`):

```csharp
